event: thinking
data: {"id": "5658bbac515d46b0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1362", "run_id": "5658bbac515d46b0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 资源事实\n1. **Pod 状态**: `phase: Pending`，container `app` 状态 `Waiting (reason: ContainerCreating)`，未启动。\n2. **调度节点**: `node2/10.2.0.50`，`PodScheduled=True`，调度成功。\n3. **关键事件**: \n   - `Warning NoNetworkFound` 重复出现约 40+ 次，持续 83 分钟。\n   - `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox` 由 multus CNI 插件触发，最近 29s 累计 377 次。\n   - 错误原文: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788433114788, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "5658bbac515d46b0-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "5658bbac515d46b0", "seq": 1363, "ts_ms": 1788433124152, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 565.33, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/5658bbac515d46b0-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "561b5d43d91f835f1d151879d86b00753fb438d458ac9c4a46f100da4b03b414", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "0a0bce1074c19a01c6f2e29557cf1c39b2a614e958dd1591960b0fb301e2f0b4"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "5658bbac515d46b0-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "5658bbac515d46b0", "seq": 1364, "ts_ms": 1788433124153, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "5658bbac515d46b0-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "5658bbac515d46b0", "seq": 1365, "ts_ms": 1788433135925, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 11.772, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2219, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，Sandbox 创建失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox ... rpc error: ... failed to setup network for sandbox \"7f2022547e54a993897c2c733a53498366fa219308352d43859e74270439677b\": plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): ... failed getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 直接确认 Pod Sandbox 创建失败，且归因于 Multus 插件在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下找不到 `unavailable-network` 网络定义 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 提供底层 CNI 插件（multus）的视角，与 kubelet 报告的一致性，确认 `unavailable-network` 资源不存在 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet | `waiting_reason: \"ContainerCreating\", container: \"app\"` | 反映 Pod 因上述网络配置错误而停滞在初始化阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container: \"app\", reason: \"ContainerCreating\") | 从监控系统侧独立验证了容器因等待原因卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态的事实 |\n\n**证据综合说明：**\nKubernetes 事件 (`fact-0299edf7ba88`, `fact-151f81412df1`) 提供了因果链的完整技术细节：Multus 在尝试加载网络 delegate 时因找不到 `unavailable-network` 而报错，导致 `kubelet` 无法创建 Pod Sandbox。`ContainerCreating` 状态 (`fact-85db3739dcd0`) 和对应 Metric (`fact-e9a4a7efbcbe`) 共同确认了这一停滞状态的当前性。Logging/Tracing 均为 `not_applicable`，符合容器未启动的物理状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 'aiops-case-05' 中缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件无法获取网络委托配置 → 网络插件执行失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **`aiops-case-05` 命名空间中缺失 `unavailable-network` 网络资源定义** (`fact-0299edf7ba88`, `fact-151f81412df1`)。该 Pod 的注解请求了此网络，但 Multus CNI 插件在集群 API 中查询不到对应的 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io` 对象，导致网络初始化环节失败，进而阻塞了整个 Pod 的 Sandbox 创建。\n\n证据不足项：当前缺乏关于 `unavailable-network` 定义为何缺失（如：未被创建、被误删、或 YAML 遗漏）的具体操作历史或配置变更记录。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，Sandbox 创建失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox ... rpc error: ... failed to setup network for sandbox \"7f2022547e54a993897c2c733a53498366fa219308352d43859e74270439677b\": plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): ... failed getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 直接确认 Pod Sandbox 创建失败，且归因于 Multus 插件在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下找不到 `unavailable-network` 网络定义 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 提供底层 CNI 插件（multus）的视角，与 kubelet 报告的一致性，确认 `unavailable-network` 资源不存在 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet | `waiting_reason: \"ContainerCreating\", container: \"app\"` | 反映 Pod 因上述网络配置错误而停滞在初始化阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container: \"app\", reason: \"ContainerCreating\") | 从监控系统侧独立验证了容器因等待原因卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态的事实 |\n\n**证据综合说明：**\nKubernetes 事件 (`fact-0299edf7ba88`, `fact-151f81412df1`) 提供了因果链的完整技术细节：Multus 在尝试加载网络 delegate 时因找不到 `unavailable-network` 而报错，导致 `kubelet` 无法创建 Pod Sandbox。`ContainerCreating` 状态 (`fact-85db3739dcd0`) 和对应 Metric (`fact-e9a4a7efbcbe`) 共同确认了这一停滞状态的当前性。Logging/Tracing 均为 `not_applicable`，符合容器未启动的物理状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 'aiops-case-05' 中缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件无法获取网络委托配置 → 网络插件执行失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **`aiops-case-05` 命名空间中缺失 `unavailable-network` 网络资源定义** (`fact-0299edf7ba88`, `fact-151f81412df1`)。该 Pod 的注解请求了此网络，但 Multus CNI 插件在集群 API 中查询不到对应的 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io` 对象，导致网络初始化环节失败，进而阻塞了整个 Pod 的 Sandbox 创建。\n\n证据不足项：当前缺乏关于 `unavailable-network` 定义为何缺失（如：未被创建、被误删、或 YAML 遗漏）的具体操作历史或配置变更记录。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

